WEBVTT

00:02.060 --> 00:06.770
<b>I didn't think I'd reunite with you on
the day when I finished all preparations.</b>

00:07.770 --> 00:12.740
<b>Maybe this is the guidance
of our captain from up in heaven.</b>

00:11.070 --> 00:13.280
<b>SEKIHO ARMY CAPTAIN
SOZO SAGARA</b>

00:13.490 --> 00:14.360
<b>Katsu?</b>

00:14.860 --> 00:19.240
<b>Sanosuke, why don't you and I
recreate the Sekiho Army once again?</b>

00:20.870 --> 00:24.540
<b>Let's crush the Revolutionary government
that framed us</b>

00:25.000 --> 00:30.210
<b>and bring to reality the new era
that Captain Sagara sought.</b>

00:31.800 --> 00:33.380
<b>I'm sorry, guys.</b>

00:34.090 --> 00:35.930
<b>I won't ask you to understand.</b>

00:36.640 --> 00:39.970
<b>But the Sekiho Army
really is special to me.</b>

00:41.140 --> 00:47.100
<b>Kenshin, the next time I see you,
I'll be a felon for a grievous crime.</b>

00:47.770 --> 00:51.940
<b>I won't mind at all if you slay me
with that sakabato.</b>

01:14.970 --> 01:16.680
<b>It's almost time. Let's go.</b>

01:18.760 --> 01:20.680
<b>Man, it's cold.</b>

01:21.180 --> 01:22.600
<b>It's spring already, too.</b>

01:22.600 --> 01:24.060
<b>What a chill.</b>

01:24.060 --> 01:26.980
<b>We still have some lingering winter cold.</b>

01:26.980 --> 01:30.520
<b>If it doesn't warm up, already, I can't...</b>

01:33.360 --> 01:34.820
<b>Wh-What was that?</b>

01:34.820 --> 01:35.820
<b>A bomb?</b>

01:36.780 --> 01:37.990
<b>Consecutive explosions!</b>

01:37.990 --> 01:40.070
<b>The culprit is still hiding inside!</b>

01:40.070 --> 01:42.700
<b>Gather all security at the gate!</b>

01:43.790 --> 01:47.620
<b>You created a time lag with the length
of the fuses. You put in some thought.</b>

01:47.620 --> 01:53.000
<b>If we can infiltrate indoors now,
our success is assured!</b>

01:53.460 --> 01:55.420
<b>The Home Ministry
will be blown to pieces!</b>

03:26.970 --> 03:30.980
<b>EPISODE 19:
TSUNAN &
NISHIKI PAINTINGS</b>

03:34.190 --> 03:35.690
<b>The lawn is on fire!</b>

03:35.690 --> 03:37.190
<b>Extinguish it! Hurry!</b>

03:39.610 --> 03:41.740
<b>We have until the cops come back.</b>

03:41.860 --> 03:43.610
<b>We'll dash across the lawn without pause!</b>

03:43.820 --> 03:44.660
<b>Don't stand still!</b>

03:50.200 --> 03:52.040
<b><i>Come to think of it...</i></b>

03:52.040 --> 03:55.460
<b><i>Captain mentioned that
before he created the Sekiho Army,</i></b>

03:55.460 --> 03:59.460
<b><i>he was forced to commit arson and robbery
to cause disturbances to the Shogunate.</i></b>

04:00.170 --> 04:01.170
<b><i>So that really...</i></b>

04:04.680 --> 04:05.800
<b>What's wrong, Katsu?</b>

04:06.300 --> 04:07.810
<b>Why are you idle?</b>

04:10.600 --> 04:11.890
<b>Kenshin.</b>

04:12.980 --> 04:16.610
<b>So he entered the Home Ministry
before we did?</b>

04:17.110 --> 04:19.320
<b>Sanosuke,
exactly what kind of guy is he?</b>

04:19.780 --> 04:24.280
<b>Himura Battosai. The man
who used to be a legendary manslayer.</b>

04:25.360 --> 04:26.320
<b>I see.</b>

04:26.820 --> 04:30.330
<b>So he's the infamous Hitokiri Battosai.</b>

04:34.120 --> 04:36.420
<b>Did you come here to take Sanosuke back?</b>

04:37.250 --> 04:38.250
<b>No.</b>

04:38.460 --> 04:41.920
<b>This is how Sanosuke
chose to act as a man.</b>

04:42.460 --> 04:44.880
<b>It is something I cannot make
any objections about.</b>

04:48.600 --> 04:52.850
<b>I came here to stop your atrocious acts.</b>

04:53.180 --> 04:54.520
<b>Sakabato.</b>

04:56.400 --> 05:00.150
<b>Once again,
an Imperialist is standing in our way.</b>

05:00.610 --> 05:01.440
<b>But...</b>

05:03.190 --> 05:04.490
<b>this time, I won't lose!</b>

05:04.490 --> 05:05.320
<b>Take this!</b>

05:08.910 --> 05:09.990
<b>Damn Imperialist!</b>

05:10.580 --> 05:12.910
<b>Yeah. That is all the more reason</b>

05:12.910 --> 05:17.080
<b>why I couldn't just brush aside
your stupid acts, that I couldn't.</b>

05:19.250 --> 05:21.750
<b>A mere hitokiri
telling me like he knows!</b>

05:21.880 --> 05:22.960
<b>Give it up!</b>

05:26.470 --> 05:27.840
<b>What about this?</b>

05:35.560 --> 05:38.310
<b>All right!
You were caught off guard, Imperialist!</b>

05:38.810 --> 05:39.650
<b>No.</b>

05:40.690 --> 05:42.270
<b>He wasn't off his guard.</b>

05:43.780 --> 05:44.820
<b>He...</b>

05:45.440 --> 05:46.700
<b>dodged that.</b>

05:50.870 --> 05:52.790
<b>Care to go further, that you do?</b>

05:59.330 --> 06:00.170
<b>Sanosuke!</b>

06:00.580 --> 06:02.040
<b>That's enough.</b>

06:02.550 --> 06:04.590
<b>You can't defeat him with stuff like that.</b>

06:05.090 --> 06:09.510
<b>We've lost too much time, and the cops
will come soon because of all the noise.</b>

06:09.510 --> 06:13.180
<b>Ridiculous! I haven't done
anything meaningful yet!</b>

06:13.180 --> 06:15.560
<b>I can't give up my greatest wish
for the past 10 years</b>

06:15.560 --> 06:16.810
<b>for something like this.</b>

06:18.350 --> 06:20.230
<b>Sa... no...</b>

06:20.480 --> 06:22.110
<b>Don't think badly of this.</b>

06:24.360 --> 06:27.950
<b>Now, how should we get outta here?</b>

06:28.450 --> 06:29.280
<b>Sano.</b>

06:33.780 --> 06:35.330
<b>It was all part of the plan, huh?</b>

06:36.450 --> 06:39.330
<b>Sorry to cause you trouble like this.</b>

06:39.830 --> 06:40.710
<b>It's nothing.</b>

06:41.460 --> 06:42.590
<b>Hey.</b>

06:43.670 --> 06:47.550
<b>If I had kept helping him out...</b>

06:47.880 --> 06:51.260
<b>would you have struck me down in the end?</b>

06:52.600 --> 06:53.430
<b>Yeah.</b>

06:53.930 --> 06:56.720
<b>I wouldn't want
a halfhearted collusion, that I don't.</b>

06:57.350 --> 06:58.770
<b>I wouldn't hold back.</b>

07:01.560 --> 07:02.860
<b>Thanks.</b>

07:14.620 --> 07:15.990
<b>My room?</b>

07:27.460 --> 07:31.470
<b>If you're looking for the bombs,
Kenshin took all of them.</b>

07:31.970 --> 07:35.470
<b>He said he'd find some place out of sight
and bury them all.</b>

07:35.680 --> 07:38.680
<b>Damn dog of the government!</b>

07:38.680 --> 07:40.850
<b>It's nothing like that.</b>

07:40.850 --> 07:44.020
<b>Was it you?
Did you lead him all the way here?</b>

07:44.440 --> 07:45.270
<b>Yeah.</b>

07:45.980 --> 07:47.020
<b>You're telling me...</b>

07:47.980 --> 07:49.780
<b>you betrayed me?</b>

07:49.780 --> 07:51.950
<b>Listen to me, Katsu.</b>

07:51.950 --> 07:52.780
<b>Shut up!</b>

07:53.110 --> 07:54.910
<b>I won't rely on you anymore!</b>

07:54.910 --> 07:56.910
<b>Katsu! What the hell are you gonna do?</b>

07:56.910 --> 07:58.120
<b>Seppuku!</b>

07:58.120 --> 07:59.200
<b>What?</b>

07:59.200 --> 08:01.910
<b>I assume the Home Ministry
still has a heart.</b>

08:02.410 --> 08:04.880
<b>I'll slice my gut open
right in front of them</b>

08:04.880 --> 08:08.170
<b>and expose the wrongdoings
of the Meiji government as I die!</b>

08:09.090 --> 08:11.760
<b>What is something like that going to do?</b>

08:11.970 --> 08:15.470
<b>My unusual death
will surely remain in people's hearts!</b>

08:15.720 --> 08:18.060
<b>That will lead to the search for truth</b>

08:18.060 --> 08:20.770
<b>and become a seed for distrust
of the Meiji government!</b>

08:20.770 --> 08:22.480
<b>No, I will make it happen!</b>

08:22.600 --> 08:24.270
<b>Gimme a break, already!</b>

08:24.350 --> 08:26.310
<b>Things ain't gonna go
that conveniently for you!</b>

08:27.820 --> 08:30.320
<b>Farewell, Sanosuke.</b>

08:34.950 --> 08:36.120
<b>A smoke bomb?</b>

08:40.830 --> 08:41.870
<b>Katsu...</b>

08:44.500 --> 08:47.460
<b>Katsu!</b>

08:47.960 --> 08:50.960
<b>RUROUNI KENSHIN</b>

09:00.180 --> 09:03.810
<b>Not just explosives,
but smoke bombs and flash bombs.</b>

09:04.310 --> 09:06.440
<b>He really is an artisan, that he is.</b>

09:06.770 --> 09:07.770
<b>Sorry for this trouble.</b>

09:08.190 --> 09:10.400
<b>It's nothing you should worry about,
that it isn't.</b>

09:10.770 --> 09:13.610
<b>I can deal with things of this sort
in any number of ways.</b>

09:14.110 --> 09:15.240
<b>However...</b>

09:17.280 --> 09:19.830
<b>the rest is your job, that it is.</b>

09:23.790 --> 09:24.620
<b>Yeah.</b>

09:29.920 --> 09:30.750
<b>Hey!</b>

09:31.340 --> 09:33.340
<b>Where are you headed this late at night?</b>

09:35.340 --> 09:36.800
<b>Hey, are you listening?</b>

09:37.010 --> 09:38.140
<b>Where are you going?</b>

09:39.220 --> 09:40.260
<b>Where?</b>

09:42.970 --> 09:45.060
<b>Where should I be going?</b>

09:45.810 --> 09:46.730
<b>What?</b>

09:50.270 --> 09:51.730
<b>Man, I passed him!</b>

10:03.700 --> 10:05.910
<b>Katsu!</b>

10:15.880 --> 10:17.680
<b>Oh, damn it!</b>

10:19.180 --> 10:20.140
<b>Stand up, damn you!</b>

10:21.300 --> 10:22.300
<b>Let me go!</b>

10:22.300 --> 10:23.470
<b>Shut up!</b>

10:23.470 --> 10:25.140
<b>You're causing me trouble!</b>

10:25.140 --> 10:26.430
<b>We're going home, damn it!</b>

10:26.430 --> 10:27.640
<b>Go home by yourself!</b>

10:28.520 --> 10:30.480
<b>I have something left undone!</b>

10:30.480 --> 10:33.570
<b>Don't mess with me anymore, you traitor!</b>

10:33.610 --> 10:34.780
<b>Huh?</b>

10:34.780 --> 10:37.280
<b>What part of me
are you callin' a traitor, damn it?</b>

10:37.530 --> 10:41.490
<b>You got in touch with an Imperialist
and foiled my plan!</b>

10:41.490 --> 10:42.910
<b>Gimme a break!</b>

10:42.910 --> 10:47.250
<b>I haven't said one word
about your plan to anyone else!</b>

10:47.250 --> 10:49.420
<b>Then why was he there?</b>

10:49.420 --> 10:50.370
<b>Hell if I know!</b>

10:50.370 --> 10:53.340
<b>He's a guy that always barges
into other people's business like that!</b>

10:53.340 --> 10:55.130
<b>I can't believe you!</b>

10:55.130 --> 10:56.960
<b>Give me back my 10 years!</b>

11:02.680 --> 11:05.390
<b>You're acting like some delinquent!</b>

11:05.510 --> 11:08.020
<b>And you still claim to be
with the Sekiho Army—</b>

11:11.650 --> 11:14.230
<b>Katsu, you...</b>

11:24.700 --> 11:26.200
<b>Don't get me wrong.</b>

11:27.160 --> 11:29.910
<b>This is enough to take you on.</b>

11:30.620 --> 11:32.370
<b>That's a relief.</b>

11:32.370 --> 11:36.880
<b>Looks like you're not rotten
in the deepest part of your heart.</b>

11:37.340 --> 11:39.010
<b>Don't feel relief.</b>

11:39.010 --> 11:42.720
<b>You've not once
been able to win against me.</b>

11:43.260 --> 11:44.600
<b>As if...</b>

11:58.150 --> 11:59.650
<b>That won't work.</b>

11:59.650 --> 12:00.780
<b>Neither will yours.</b>

12:00.900 --> 12:03.200
<b>You slacked off too much, Sanosuke.</b>

12:03.490 --> 12:04.570
<b>Huh?</b>

12:04.570 --> 12:05.530
<b>Gimme a br—</b>

12:16.130 --> 12:17.250
<b>Quit it.</b>

12:17.800 --> 12:20.260
<b>You can't win against me in a fight.</b>

12:20.970 --> 12:23.590
<b>This is... not a fight.</b>

12:27.100 --> 12:30.390
<b>In order to clear the 10-year grudge
of the Sekiho Army</b>

12:30.390 --> 12:32.180
<b>and to bring its pride back...</b>

12:32.520 --> 12:33.890
<b>this is a battle!</b>

12:35.310 --> 12:37.110
<b>That's why I will not lose!</b>

12:37.110 --> 12:38.360
<b>I cannot lose!</b>

12:38.360 --> 12:42.440
<b>Sanosuke! The 10 years I spent
were completely different from yours!</b>

12:44.450 --> 12:45.780
<b>Sanosuke!</b>

12:46.660 --> 12:49.080
<b>In the 10 years that our captain
was disgraced,</b>

12:49.080 --> 12:53.370
<b>while the Meiji government
blamed the Sekiho Army,</b>

12:53.370 --> 12:55.120
<b>what the hell were you doing?</b>

12:55.120 --> 12:56.920
<b>You spent all your time in petty fights,</b>

12:56.920 --> 13:00.670
<b>and then you got all buddy-buddy
with a former Imperialist?</b>

13:00.670 --> 13:06.340
<b>What did you learn
from the Sekiho Army and our captain?</b>

13:09.180 --> 13:11.100
<b>Enough of that!</b>

13:11.600 --> 13:13.850
<b>You have no right to say that!</b>

13:13.850 --> 13:15.440
<b>What exactly are you?</b>

13:15.440 --> 13:19.270
<b>You were cooped up in your own
little shell for 10 years and made bombs!</b>

13:19.270 --> 13:23.860
<b>There were many other ways
to clear the name of our captain!</b>

13:24.150 --> 13:28.820
<b>In the first place,
you're 10 years too late to accuse 'em!</b>

13:29.950 --> 13:32.080
<b>What... do you mean?</b>

13:32.290 --> 13:34.580
<b>Whether we rot away for 10 years,</b>

13:34.580 --> 13:36.540
<b>whether the Meiji government
goes corrupt...</b>

13:36.540 --> 13:40.840
<b>the guys in town are creating a new world
with their own hands!</b>

13:41.550 --> 13:43.510
<b>You saw them, didn't you?</b>

13:43.510 --> 13:45.380
<b>That dojo girl
is running around every day,</b>

13:45.380 --> 13:49.050
<b>trying to spread swordsmanship
in this Meiji world!</b>

13:49.430 --> 13:54.600
<b>Yahiko was born to a samurai family,
but he's as good as forsaken.</b>

13:54.600 --> 13:56.890
<b>Even then, he doesn't pout at all</b>

13:56.890 --> 13:58.980
<b>and swings that bamboo sword
morning and night!</b>

13:59.520 --> 14:03.320
<b>That girl doctor Megumi
was roped into some shady business,</b>

14:03.320 --> 14:06.820
<b>but she's since turned herself around and
is checking on the sick people in town!</b>

14:07.110 --> 14:11.530
<b>Shu and Ginji have never complained
about their current situations!</b>

14:11.530 --> 14:15.450
<b>They're desperate every day,
but still live each day laughing!</b>

14:16.210 --> 14:18.620
<b>And after everything that's happened,</b>

14:18.620 --> 14:22.090
<b>they all sat down together
for food and booze last night.</b>

14:22.090 --> 14:24.260
<b>Ain't that the equality
for the four classes</b>

14:24.260 --> 14:27.170
<b>that the captain was aiming for, huh?</b>

14:27.630 --> 14:30.970
<b>Then, what I am trying to do...</b>

14:30.970 --> 14:33.260
<b>It's useless! It's only trouble!</b>

14:41.190 --> 14:43.230
<b>Useless, you say?</b>

14:46.860 --> 14:51.820
<b>Katsu, even if you commit seppuku,
the world won't move because of it.</b>

14:53.490 --> 14:56.790
<b>Everyone is living in the present day.</b>

14:58.750 --> 14:59.870
<b>Let's go home.</b>

15:03.000 --> 15:05.960
<b>Sanosuke, where is Battosai?</b>

15:06.880 --> 15:10.470
<b>If he were to hand over my bombs
to the government...</b>

15:11.140 --> 15:14.510
<b>I told you. He ain't someone like that.</b>

15:15.680 --> 15:16.850
<b>He's just like us.</b>

15:16.850 --> 15:21.940
<b>He doesn't think well
of how the government is run right now.</b>

15:22.940 --> 15:26.690
<b>No, because he was part of creating
the current government,</b>

15:26.690 --> 15:27.990
<b>he feels it even more than us.</b>

15:28.570 --> 15:30.280
<b>Don't be silly.</b>

15:30.280 --> 15:32.320
<b>What does a mere manslayer know about us?</b>

15:32.820 --> 15:33.660
<b>He knows.</b>

15:36.910 --> 15:41.170
<b>A former manslayer who had a taste
of countless shady acts including murder</b>

15:41.170 --> 15:45.170
<b>as an active member behind the scenes
of the Meiji Revolution.</b>

15:45.590 --> 15:46.880
<b>That is all the more reason...</b>

15:47.550 --> 15:51.760
<b>he couldn't just stand by
and watch us do something shady.</b>

15:54.220 --> 15:55.350
<b>Hey, Katsu...</b>

15:55.680 --> 15:58.140
<b>Our captain mentioned
he did some shady stuff</b>

15:58.140 --> 16:00.180
<b>before his days in the Sekiho Army.</b>

16:00.850 --> 16:03.730
<b>But I don't think
he did all that willingly.</b>

16:04.100 --> 16:06.360
<b>The Sekiho Army was a squad that lived</b>

16:06.360 --> 16:08.860
<b>under the ideals of equality
for the four classes.</b>

16:09.440 --> 16:12.400
<b>We can't tarnish its name
after all this time.</b>

16:14.620 --> 16:17.700
<b>I don't care if it's pure or tarnished!</b>

16:17.700 --> 16:21.120
<b>There is no need to think about the means
to fulfill our objectives!</b>

16:21.580 --> 16:22.750
<b>I see.</b>

16:23.460 --> 16:27.590
<b>That means we really
will become a fake Imperial Army.</b>

16:29.880 --> 16:32.470
<b><i>Nobody ever picks this one up.</i></b>

16:32.470 --> 16:36.430
<b>SEKIHO ARMY CAPTAIN
SOZO SAGARA</b>

16:32.680 --> 16:35.090
<b><i>Not the leader of a fake Imperial Army.</i></b>

16:40.270 --> 16:42.980
<b>Just because the government dudes
are all corrupted,</b>

16:43.390 --> 16:45.980
<b>that doesn't mean
that we gotta stoop to their level.</b>

16:46.480 --> 16:49.020
<b>It doesn't matter if it's slow and steady.</b>

16:49.480 --> 16:52.950
<b>Such a path that our captain
will smile upon me from the afterlife...</b>

16:53.610 --> 16:55.360
<b>that's the path I'll take.</b>

17:47.290 --> 17:48.210
<b><i>Captain...</i></b>

17:52.630 --> 17:53.800
<b>What's wrong?</b>

17:53.800 --> 17:59.010
<b>Oh, Sanosuke ate Katsuhiro's fish
without permission or something.</b>

17:59.470 --> 18:01.970
<b>Well, they're arguing like usual.</b>

18:02.430 --> 18:03.520
<b>I see.</b>

18:04.180 --> 18:07.230
<b>Come on, Sanosuke!
Get him down without stopping!</b>

18:07.230 --> 18:09.270
<b>Katsu, you better not give up!</b>

18:09.860 --> 18:11.940
<b>You won't lose until you say you give up!</b>

18:12.480 --> 18:15.570
<b>Stop it! There's no way
you can win against me!</b>

18:15.570 --> 18:20.280
<b>Shut up! I won't lose
until I get my stolen trout back!</b>

18:20.740 --> 18:22.240
<b>You're so stubborn!</b>

18:23.700 --> 18:25.910
<b>What's wrong, Sanosuke?</b>

18:26.080 --> 18:27.460
<b>Katsuhiro! The legs!</b>

18:32.250 --> 18:34.960
<b>Katsuhiro won.</b>

18:35.590 --> 18:37.510
<b>Man, you did it!</b>

18:38.680 --> 18:40.140
<b>Ow.</b>

18:42.390 --> 18:43.600
<b>Well done.</b>

18:46.310 --> 18:49.400
<b>You should fight in your own way.</b>

18:59.780 --> 19:01.910
<b>My own way...</b>

19:10.370 --> 19:14.210
<b>So, how is Tsunan Tsukioka
doing since, that is?</b>

19:14.420 --> 19:15.710
<b>Who knows?</b>

19:15.710 --> 19:16.550
<b>Oro?</b>

19:16.760 --> 19:21.590
<b>I totally pummeled him, so I kinda
feel awkward and haven't gone to see him.</b>

19:23.550 --> 19:28.020
<b>Oh! If it isn't the young man
from the other day!</b>

19:28.020 --> 19:29.520
<b>What perfect timing!</b>

19:29.690 --> 19:32.650
<b>Oh. Sorry about the other day.</b>

19:32.650 --> 19:33.690
<b>You need something?</b>

19:33.690 --> 19:34.820
<b>Yeah.</b>

19:34.820 --> 19:38.320
<b>There was something
Mr. Tsukioka asked me to give to you.</b>

19:39.360 --> 19:42.530
<b>He said it was the final Nishiki painting
from Tsunan Tsukioka.</b>

19:43.990 --> 19:46.080
<b>I don't know what got into him,</b>

19:46.080 --> 19:49.000
<b>but he suddenly said he was going
to start an illustrated newspaper</b>

19:49.000 --> 19:51.620
<b>and correct the tyranny
of the government with it.</b>

19:52.170 --> 19:55.670
<b>I told him that he shouldn't, because they
crack down pretty hard, but...</b>

19:56.460 --> 20:00.720
<b>Oh, man.
He was a really popular artist, too.</b>

20:01.930 --> 20:05.680
<b>SEKIHO ARMY
CAPTAIN SOZO SAGARA</b>

20:02.380 --> 20:05.470
<b>It's really a shame, mister.</b>

21:43.940 --> 21:47.410
<b>So, what was the ruckus
the other day all about?</b>

21:48.030 --> 21:52.700
<b>Well, the courtyard lawn
was charred in several spots,</b>

21:52.700 --> 21:55.790
<b>and there was damage
to a part of the wall,</b>

21:55.790 --> 21:58.880
<b>but no further damage
to the facility nor personnel.</b>

21:59.590 --> 22:01.250
<b>There was no claim of responsibility,</b>

22:01.250 --> 22:04.880
<b>so we're investigating the incident
as a malicious prank.</b>

22:05.050 --> 22:08.720
<b>It's springtime after all,
so there will be a few loonies out there.</b>

22:09.680 --> 22:10.510
<b>Um...</b>

22:11.260 --> 22:15.520
<b>can it be the doings
of someone from Shishio's group?</b>

22:15.640 --> 22:17.480
<b>D-Don't be ridiculous!</b>

22:17.600 --> 22:20.940
<b>Them? Here at the Home Ministry?
Impossible!</b>

22:21.860 --> 22:22.900
<b>Kawaji.</b>

22:23.070 --> 22:23.900
<b>Yes, sir.</b>

22:24.190 --> 22:28.160
<b>There have been no sightings
of Shishio's group in the Tokyo area.</b>

22:28.660 --> 22:30.910
<b>Please rest assured, Sir Okubo.</b>

22:31.410 --> 22:32.370
<b>Hmm.</b>

22:33.330 --> 22:37.080
<b>If it was their doing,
there should have been some casualties.</b>

22:37.410 --> 22:39.750
<b>However, we cannot drop our guard.</b>

22:40.330 --> 22:42.460
<b>Please continue the investigation.</b>

22:42.460 --> 22:43.300
<b>Yes, sir!</b>

22:44.920 --> 22:49.930
<b>NEXT EPISODE
MEIJI SWORDSMAN
ROMANTIC STORY
ACT ZERO
PART ONE</b>

22:45.510 --> 22:49.390
<b><i>Next episode, "Meiji Swordsman
Romantic Story, Act Zero, Part One."</i></b>
